{"game": "risk-of-rain-2013", "language": "english", "appid": 248820, "month": "2022-03", "window": 3, "start_date": 1647388800, "end_date": 1648079999, "month_true_total": 101, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 09:20:37 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "112705388", "author": {"steamid": "76561198355190722", "personaname": "PersistantGamer", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198355190722/", "num_games_owned": 218, "num_reviews": 73, "playtime_forever": 2416, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2416, "last_played": 1565522624, "avatar": "ea096326adf38f43dd0aa6eb9fde6cb4fc83bd0a"}, "language": "english", "review": "Inferior to Risk of Rain 2 for lacking proper multiplayer without mods or workarounds, but still a classic worth buying.\n\nThough, you shouldn't buy this if you dislike repetition, this game is built off the foundation of do it again and again. It is a roguelike, after all.", "timestamp_created": 1648055377, "timestamp_updated": 1648055377, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "112681091", "author": {"steamid": "76561198141081888", "personaname": "Emmally", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198141081888/", "num_games_owned": 526, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 3828, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3771, "last_played": 1699866589, "avatar": "62290681848b99e427f0a1ab984cfbe7f88ecf91"}, "language": "english", "review": "Game is extremely fun and it is neat seeing where risk of rain 2 items and enemies come from (also mods for this game are really good)", "timestamp_created": 1648017566, "timestamp_updated": 1648017566, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "112659716", "author": {"steamid": "76561198053667184", "personaname": "Zeks 🤡🎭🎃", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ZeksMorshar/", "num_games_owned": 809, "num_reviews": 99, "playtime_forever": 3996, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3996, "last_played": 1647978186, "avatar": "cd9dc4d7c22609d659a327e382b43c725af82811"}, "language": "english", "review": "Even after all this time this title still holds up, it's fun and all the item combinations really add to the experience and satisfy that looter-esk hit of getting a new item.\n\nIt has a sequel that has made a smooth transition into the 3D space but even then the original still has not just its own style but its own quirks as well due to the sidescrolling perspective.\n\nWhether you're playing it solo or with friends I do genuinely recommend Risk of Rain.", "timestamp_created": 1647978366, "timestamp_updated": 1647978366, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "112641914", "author": {"steamid": "76561198002201484", "personaname": "snowstormBG", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198002201484/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 35, "playtime_forever": 3985, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3985, "last_played": 1638560138, "avatar": "9b09b48051b2be651144078e1218bf950e8fb713"}, "language": "english", "review": "Just how I remembered it and still delivered a 50+ hour enjoyable experience.\n\nThe developers hit a good challenge that later*(not always) devolves into a power fantasy. When you get overpowered, it feels like you earned it.", "timestamp_created": 1647952591, "timestamp_updated": 1647952591, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "112637136", "author": {"steamid": "76561198076856556", "personaname": "Canner1", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Canner1/", "num_games_owned": 261, "num_reviews": 106, "playtime_forever": 2085, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2085, "last_played": 1546894105, "avatar": "c83245a480f1b10ce32a29a4b64b71d092733895"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is a certified hood classic. Friends and I have spent countless hours playing on LAN back in Highschool. The graphics may look bad, but there's a certain charm to it's simplicity. Definitely pick this one up if you and your friends like a challenging game.", "timestamp_created": 1647943919, "timestamp_updated": 1647943919, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 17, "count": 1}]}]}